  <section class="section about-stack" aria-label="Technology stack">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="columns is-vcentered is-variable is-8">

        <div class="column is-12-mobile is-5-desktop reveal">
          <span class="about-section-label">How it's built</span>
          <h2 class="title is-2 mt-2 mb-4">The stack</h2>
          <div class="content is-medium">
            <p>
              Every technology choice in this project was intentional. <strong>Ghost</strong> for its clean publishing model and strong content API. <strong>Bulma</strong> because it stays out of the way and lets you build fast without wrestling a framework. <strong>Custom SCSS</strong> for a proper design token system inspired by SLDS.
            </p>
            <p>
              The entire codebase is open source, readable, and built to be extended. You can fork it, improve it, and build your own Salesforce learning platform on top of it.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://github.com/imswarnil/Namaste-Salesforce"
             target="_blank" rel="noopener"
             class="button is-primary mt-2">
            <span class="icon"><i class="ph ph-github-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
            <span>View on GitHub</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="column is-12-mobile is-7-desktop reveal reveal--delay-1">
          <div class="about-stack-grid">
            <div class="about-stack-item box">
              <i class="ph ph-ghost about-stack-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <h4 class="title is-6 mt-2 mb-1">Ghost CMS</h4>
              <p>Publishing engine, content API, member system, newsletter — the spine of the platform.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stack-item box">
              <i class="ph ph-layout about-stack-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <h4 class="title is-6 mt-2 mb-1">Bulma CSS</h4>
              <p>Responsive grid, components, utilities — clean, readable, zero JavaScript.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stack-item box">
              <i class="ph ph-brackets-curly about-stack-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <h4 class="title is-6 mt-2 mb-1">Custom SCSS</h4>
              <p>Design token system, SLDS-inspired variables, dark mode, accent color support.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stack-item box">
              <i class="ph ph-robot about-stack-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <h4 class="title is-6 mt-2 mb-1">AI &amp; Tools</h4>
              <p>Claude, Cursor, and smart tooling used throughout content creation and theme development.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stack-item box">
              <i class="ph ph-phosphor-logo about-stack-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <h4 class="title is-6 mt-2 mb-1">Phosphor Icons</h4>
              <p>Clean, consistent icon system used throughout every component and template.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-stack-item box about-stack-item--open">
